      "title" : "Help me fine-tune a behavior. ",
      "updatedAt" : "2026-07-14T17:56:00Z",
      "value" : "I want to adjust the behavior of this element: [Describe the element\/interaction or paste the code here]. \n\nPlease analyze its current behavior and break it down into labeled, adjustable components (for example: [A] Trigger, [B] Keyframes\/States, [C] Timing\/Duration, [D] Easing\/Curve, [E] Visual Properties). \n\nOnce you provide this breakdown, I will give you feedback using those labels so I can easily say \"Change A to...\" or \"Adjust C to...\". ",
      "visibility" : "public"
    },
